# Firebase Connection Documentation

## 1. Project Overview

This project is a Vite + React application for Prime Housing with both a public-facing website and an admin console. Firebase is integrated for:

- Firebase Authentication (email/password admin sign-in)
- Firestore database access for properties, submissions, enquiries, users, and admin audit logs
- Firebase Storage for property and submission image uploads
- Firebase Admin SDK usage in backend functions and operational scripts

The project uses Firebase Web SDK in the front-end and Firebase Admin SDK in backend/server-side code under `functions/` and `scripts/`.

Relevant project files:

- `src/firebase.js`
- `src/admin/context/AdminAuthContext.jsx`
